{'symbol': 'CHRW', 'date': '2023-01-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'C.H. ROBINSON INITIATES LEADERSHIP TRANSITION', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--C.H. ROBINSON WORLDWIDE, INC. (“C.H. ROBINSON”) (NASDAQ: CHRW) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT SCOTT ANDERSON, CHAIR OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS BEEN APPOINTED INTERIM CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023. BOB BIESTERFELD HAS STEPPED DOWN AS PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND AS A MEMBER OF THE BOARD, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}